'''Growing Strange''' (進化の古代マタタビ, ''Shinka no Kodai Matatabi'', '''Evolution Ancient Actinidia''') is a [[Catfruit]] gathering event unlocked after clearing [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and is available on all days of the week, but only for a period of time. By clearing any of its [[Continuation Stage]]s, you will get an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit Seed]], or on rare occasions, an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit]]. All stages are listed as '''Merciless''', but in the Japanese and Traditional Chinese versions, they were once listed as Deadly.

