'''Note''': Because the second stages are all continuations, it is impossible to use [[Battle Items]] (except for Speed Ups) in any stage except the first. The player also cannot edit their lineup in any way between stages. Each Continuation Stage has 99% chance to drop an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit Seed]] and  1% chance to drop an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit]].

